% series field, per the house style; elsarticle-harv renders that agency-first,
% as "U.S. Geological Survey Techniques and Methods, book 6, chap. A55".
%
% Do not write an at-sign followed by an entry type in these comments: BibTeX
% treats the at-sign as the start of an entry even on a comment line, and skips
% to the next one with "I was expecting a { or a (".

